<section class=\"section stone-band\"><div class=\"container\"><p class=\"eyebrow\">Material choices</p><h2>Made to live with.</h2><div class=\"material-grid\"><article><h3>Honest surfaces</h3><p>Timber that reveals its grain. Plaster that catches the light. Materials chosen for their inherent qualities, rather than a passing finish.</p></article><article><h3>Care over time</h3><p>We consider how surfaces weather, how parts can be repaired and how a small choice now can make maintenance simpler later.</p></article><article><h3>What is already here</h3><p>Existing fabric is a resource. We look for opportunities to retain, adapt and reuse before introducing something new.</p></article></div></div></section>
